Significance: minor
Type: added

Charts: new `legend.collapseGroups` option folds series that share a `group` into a single legend item, labelled by the group's primary series; with `legend.interactive` that item toggles the whole group in one click. Off by default, so legends keep one item per series unless you opt in. Available on the bar, line and area charts. The line chart's value axis now also stays fixed as series are toggled, and when every series is hidden the grid and axes are dropped so the empty state stands on its own.
